{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121911","id":4164013167,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74Mcxv","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121911","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121911.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121911.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121911","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121911/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121911/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121911/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f89f1cad434202511d8b90e0452a62a90da02352","number":121911,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Tree: Fix CELL_MODE_RANGE auto-tooltip showing all comma-separated options","user":{"login":"amenhany","id":179514017,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrMqoQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179514017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany","html_url":"https://github.com/amenhany","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Refactor range cell text resolution into a `_get_range_cell_text` helper method. Use this helper in `get_tooltip` to display only the selected option label, and update `update_item_cell` to eliminate duplicated logic.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #121888\r\n\r\n`Tree` cells in `CELL_MODE_RANGE` store their options as a comma-separated string in the `text` field (e.g., `\"Has,Many,Options\"`). When auto-tooltip is enabled and no explicit tooltip is set, the tooltip fallback previously returned `it->get_text(col)`. This resulted in the tooltip displaying the full raw comma-separated string containing all options, rather than only the active selection.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces a private `_get_range_cell_text()` helper method on `Tree` that resolves the individual selected option label from a range cell's text.\r\n\r\nKey changes:\r\n- Extracted the range text resolution logic directly from `update_item_cell()` into `_get_range_cell_text()`, consolidating the string parsing into a single reusable helper.\r\n- Updated the tooltip fallback in `get_tooltip()` to use this helper for `CELL_MODE_RANGE` cells, so tooltips display only the selected option's label (or `\"(Other)\"` / numeric fallbacks) instead of the full comma-separated string.\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure\r\n\r\nAI was used to assist in locating relevant methods during codebase exploration, to review the code changes against the rest of the codebase, and to format this PR description. All code changes were manually reviewed, compiled, and verified locally.\r\n\r\n### Visual Comparison\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| :---: | :---: |\r\n| ![Before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15c0eef1-df7d-42d0-8f77-66dbb30335e0) | ![After](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d66dcbeb-e37f-4877-abeb-3843eecbc20c) |","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","up